Chords Theory Enhanced

Thanks for installing Chords Theory Enhanced (a community fork of Chords Theory
by Sebastien Halbeher / Nierika). Pick "VST3" and/or "AU" above depending on which
plugin format your DAW uses, then load it as an instrument/MIDI plugin under its
usual third-party plugin location. Selecting "Standalone" installs a regular app
in /Applications that you can launch directly, without a DAW.
